# Deck media. The seminar's images and videos come to ~826 MB, which does not
# belong in a git repository -- clones would carry it forever and GitHub warns
# above 50 MB per file (two of the videos are 66 MB and 49 MB). The deck sources
# ARE tracked on this branch; the media lives alongside them on disk. Use Git LFS
# if these ever need to travel with the repo.
static/images/
static/videos/

